      ],
      "priority": 4,
      "description": "Record why each tag was assigned (which ingredients triggered it, which rules matched) so users can understand and verify automated tagging decisions.\n\n**Blocked on:** UX design for how to display the audit trail (tooltip? expandable section? separate view?)\n\nFrom tagging system improvement plan item 2b."
    },
    {
