      "description": "During onboarding, show the most common allergens upfront and hide less common ones behind a \"Visa fler\" expansion. Reduces initial overwhelm while keeping full coverage accessible.\n\n**Blocked on:** UX design for the onboarding flow.\n\nFrom tagging system improvement plan item 5b."
